      "title": "九年级 U8 听力·短文 The Mystery of Stonehenge",
      "type": "passage",
      "kind": "short",
      "speaker": "us_female",
      "transcript": [
        "Stonehenge is a famous mystery in Britain.",
        "It is a circle of very large, heavy stones.",
        "No one knows for sure why it was built.",
        "It might have been a temple or a place for medical care.",
        "How the stones were moved is still a mystery today."
      ],
