      "code": "g9u8.l.06",
      "volume": "9",
      "unit": "U8",
      "title": "九年级 U8 听力·短文 Making Guesses",
      "type": "passage",
      "kind": "short",
      "speaker": "us_female",
      "transcript": [
        "In daily life, we often make guesses with special words.",
        "If we are very sure, we use must.",
        "If we are less sure, we use might or could.",
        "If we think something is impossible, we use can't.",
        "Making good guesses helps us understand the world."
      ],
      "translation_cn": "在日常生活中,我们常常用特定的词来做猜测。\n如果我们很确定,就用must。\n如果不太确定,就用might或could。\n如果我们认为某事不可能,就用can't。\n做出好的猜测有助于我们理解世界。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "qid": "g9u8.l.06.q1",
          "volume": "9",
          "unit": "U8",
          "code": "g9u8.l.06",
          "stem": "What do we make in daily life?",
          "options": [
            "Rules.",
            "Lists.",
            "Guesses.",
            "Plans."
          ],
          "answer_index": 2,
          "answer_text": "Guesses."
        },
